%% Diagram: Weekly Digest Workflow
%% ID: ECOMDY-D24 | Version: 0.1 | State: Target proposal, not as-built
flowchart LR
  trigger["Owner-approved schedule triggers automatic weekly run"] --> window["Select date range and audience"]
  window --> eligible["Select eligible events and verified evidence"]
  eligible --> draft["Draft one cited item per selected event"]
  draft --> checks["Check citations, dates, conflicts and unsupported claims"]
  checks --> review["Marketing / Content editorial review"]
  review --> decision{"Approve exact version?"}
  decision -->|No| revise["Return for edit; new version"] --> checks
  decision -->|Yes| snapshot["Save approved version and evidence links"]
  snapshot --> output["Digest ready for owner-controlled use"]
